00:11:10.801 --> 00:11:13.367
-I worked at a place
called the Viking Drive In.

00:11:13.367 --> 00:11:15.734
I like flipped burgers
at a little tiny

00:11:15.734 --> 00:11:17.767
drive-through burger joint.

00:11:17.767 --> 00:11:19.334
-Fun.
-It was awesome.

00:11:19.334 --> 00:11:20.467
-Yeah.
-It was great.

00:11:20.467 --> 00:11:22.200
I could walk,
I could rollerblade there.

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:23.501
I rollerbladed everywhere
as a kid.

00:11:23.501 --> 00:11:25.734
I mean, I'm painting
a pretty awesome picture.

00:11:25.734 --> 00:11:27.300
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.
-Who I was as a kid.

00:11:27.300 --> 00:11:29.801
-You were a cool kid, man.
-Really cool.

00:11:29.801 --> 00:11:32.133
Super cool.
-So cool.

00:11:32.133 --> 00:11:34.501
-It was really fun. It was --
The Viking Drive--

00:11:34.501 --> 00:11:35.734
-You would operate
the drive-through?

00:11:35.734 --> 00:11:36.934
-I would operate
the drive-through.

00:11:36.934 --> 00:11:38.334
I'd take people's orders.
It was right kitty-corner

00:11:38.334 --> 00:11:39.868
to this place
called the Mini Mart,

00:11:39.868 --> 00:11:41.701
which was like the hangout
for -- it was a small town,

00:11:41.701 --> 00:11:43.901
maybe 7,000 people
when I lived there.

00:11:43.901 --> 00:11:46.701
And Lake Stevens, Washington,

00:11:46.701 --> 00:11:48.834
and people would go
get out of their car

00:11:48.834 --> 00:11:50.367
and go into the mini mart

00:11:50.367 --> 00:11:52.868
and I would be hidden
in the Viking Drive In

00:11:52.868 --> 00:11:56.133
over the intercom
and I would mess with them.

00:11:56.133 --> 00:11:58.501
I'd be like,
"Hey, buddy, I need your help."

00:11:58.501 --> 00:12:00.334
[ Laughter ]

00:12:00.334 --> 00:12:02.400
-People looking around.
"Who's saying that?"

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:03.834
Yeah, yeah, exactly.

00:12:03.834 --> 00:12:05.934
-I'd be like, "It's me. God."

00:12:05.934 --> 00:12:08.067
[ Laughter ]

00:12:08.067 --> 00:12:09.434
It was awesome.
-Coming from a drive-through

00:12:09.434 --> 00:12:12.601
speaker like, "This is the
calling, God talking to me."

00:12:12.601 --> 00:12:13.868
-It was pretty great.
-But it must have been good

00:12:13.868 --> 00:12:15.801
